{"id":1571,"date":"2016-09-06T20:19:38","date_gmt":"2016-09-07T01:19:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=1571"},"modified":"2016-09-06T20:19:38","modified_gmt":"2016-09-07T01:19:38","slug":"what-no-can-opener","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/06\/what-no-can-opener\/","title":{"rendered":"What? No Can Opener??????"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>What the heck? \u00a0Didn&#8217;t we bring a can opener?<\/p>\n<p>We pulled in to Fallen Rock RV Park about 6:30 or so and I really didn&#8217;t feel like getting the charcoal grill out and fired up. \u00a0It was hot and muggy and we both needed a shower. \u00a0We decided to close the windows and turn on the A\/C units and just make some tuna salad sandwiches for dinner.<\/p>\n<p>But wait &#8230;. where the h___ is the can opener? \u00a0Kathy was ready to give up, but not Herbie!<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1565\" src=\"\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-06-19-46-00.jpg\" alt=\"2016-09-06-19-46-00\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-06-19-46-00.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-06-19-46-00-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-06-19-46-00-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/2016-09-06-19-46-00-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Needle nose pliers and a hammer did the trick. \u00a0I made up tuna salad with a little chopped onion, spread it on some rye bread, put on a slice or two of provolone and fired up the George Foreman grill and we had paninis!<\/p>\n<p>Hey by the way, Kathy found that Sav-A-Lot carries Reeser&#8217;s brand red potato salad &#8230; and it&#8217;s yummy! \u00a0Walmart also has an excellent red potato salad. \u00a0You can find it in their deli section but it IS prepackaged, not the bulk stuff they sell in the glass case.<\/p>\n<p>Until next time,<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-19\" src=\"\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2011\/09\/herbonlycolor1.jpg\" alt=\"HerbOnlyColor\" width=\"143\" height=\"67\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>What the heck? \u00a0Didn&#8217;t we bring a can opener? We pulled in to Fallen Rock RV Park about 6:30 or so and I really didn&#8217;t feel like getting the charcoal grill out and fired up. \u00a0It was hot and muggy and we both needed a shower. \u00a0We decided to close the windows and turn on &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/06\/what-no-can-opener\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">What? No Can Opener??????<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,586],"tags":[1384157,13789],"class_list":["post-1571","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-food","tag-can-opener","tag-dinner"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1571","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1571"}],"version-history":[{"count":15,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1571\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1586,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1571\/revisions\/1586"}],"wp:attachme